Product brochures — one PDF per model, served straight from here.

Filenames are listed in /CATALOGUES-NEEDED.txt at the repository root.
Each one is the product's photo filename with a .pdf extension, so
hpa-b35.png and hpa-b35.pdf are the same machine.

Empty for now. Dropping a file in does not by itself put a button on the
page: the card needs one line of HTML pointing at it, because a static
site cannot test whether a file exists and a button that 404s is worse
than no button.
